0} b c → r (f b) (f c)","unsafe":false,"value":139,"source":{"code":"theorem Nat.rel_of_forall_rel_succ_of_le_of_lt (r : β → β → Prop) [IsTrans β r] {f : ℕ → β} {a : ℕ}\n    (h : ∀ n, a ≤ n → r (f n) (f (n + 1))) ⦃b c : ℕ⦄ (hab : a ≤ b) (hbc : b < c) :\n    r (f b) (f c) := by\n  induction hbc with\n  | refl => exact h _ hab\n  | step b_lt_k r_b_k => exact _root_.trans r_b_k (h _ (hab.trans_lt b_lt_k).le)","start":529,"end":534},"axioms":[]}